t.sh\\\" --goal-paragraph \\\"$P\\\" 02-verify-and-handoff 11.1 '\\\"'Allowed single-work-unit goal exception: this is a standalone verification and handoff outcome, which the planning skill permits as a single verification work unit.'\\nfor spec in \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/01-step-initial-markup|5.1|Create button-chain.html with a document body containing a named root subtree #button-chain-root and exactly one visible initial button. Do not add generated buttons in the static markup.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/01-step-initial-markup|6.1|Pass when the future file has exactly one initial button at load, the root subtree is identifiable as #button-chain-root, and no generated buttons are pre-rendered.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/01-step-initial-markup|7.1|W02 can rely on a single initial button target inside #button-chain-root.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/02-step-append-handler|5.1|Add the click behavior for the current-last-button path in button-chain.html. The handler must append exactly one new button below the current last button and then make that new button the current last button.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/02-step-append-handler|6.1|Pass when each valid current-last click before completion increases the button count by one, appends the new button below the previous last button, and does not append multiple buttons.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/02-step-append-handler|7.1|W03 can rely on generated buttons being counted in append order and the current-last reference being accurate.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/03-step-completion-branch|5.1|Extend the script so the click on generated button 4 clears the document body and renders the completion state instead of appending another button.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/03-step-completion-branch|6.1|Pass when generated buttons 1 through 3 continue the chain and clicking generated button 4 removes prior document content and shows only the completion view.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/03-step-completion-branch|7.1|W04 can rely on a completion element being rendered by the completion branch.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/04-step-completion-style|5.1|Add style for .completion-message in button-chain.html so the completion state text remains exactly finished and has a visible white border.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/04-step-completion-style|6.1|Pass when the completion element displays exact lowercase finished and the white border is visible against the page background without hiding or clipping the text.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/04-step-completion-style|7.1|W06 and W05 can rely on the completion selector and visual border acceptance criterion.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/05-step-implementation-review|5.1|After future implementation exists, review button-chain.html against W01 through W04 without making changes in this step. Confirm all implementation targets are ready for browser validation.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/05-step-implementation-review|6.1|Pass when the review confirms the static markup, append handler, completion branch, and completion style all match their step acceptance criteria.' \\\\\\\\\\n'01-create-button-chain/05-step-implementation-review|7.1|W05 can rely on implementation readiness and should run US-01 next.' \\\\\\\\\\n'02-verify-and-handoff/01-step-browser-story|5.1|Open the future completed button-chain.html in a browser and execute US-01 using real mouse clicks on the current last visible button: initial button, generated button 1, generated button 2, generated button 3, then generated button 4.' \\\\\\\\\\n'02-verify-and-handoff/01-step-browser-story|6.1|Pass only if each non-final click appends exactly one button below the previous last button, the final generated-button-4 click clears the document, and the only completion content is exact lowercase finished with a visible white border.' \\\\\\\\\\n'02-verify-and-handoff/01-step-browser-story|7.1|The final handoff must include the browser evidence, story status, and bug-register status. If US-01 fails, record a bug and do not mark the initiative complete.'\\ndo\\n  IFS='|' read -r step para text <<< \\\\\\\"\\\"'$spec\\\"\\n  \\\"$S/update-plan-content.sh\\\" --step-paragraph \\\"$P\\\" \\\"$step\\\" \\\"$para\\\" \\\"$text\\\"\\ndone\\n\\\"$S/plan-mutate.sh\\\" rebuild-progress \\\"$P/01-create-button-chain\\\"\\n\\\"$S/plan-mutate.sh\\\" rebuild-progress \\\"$P/02-verify-and-handoff\\\"\\n\\\"$S/validate-plan.sh\\\" \\\"$P\\\"'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"Updated section\\nUpdated paragraph\\nUpdated section\\nUpdated section\\nUpdated section\\nUpdated section\\nUpdated section\\nUpdated section\\nUpdated paragraph\\nReminder: testing instructions already exist at .plans/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T152024Z-old-plan-iterative-isolated-plan/01-create-button-chain/steps/01-step-initial-markup-testing.md; review them for accuracy and completeness after updating this step.\\nUpdated paragraph\\nReminder: testing instructions already exist at .plans/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T152024Z-old-plan-iterative-isolated-plan/01-create-button-chain/steps/01-step-initial-markup-testing.md; review them for accuracy and completeness after updating this step.\\nUpdated paragraph\\nReminder: testing instructions already exist at .plans/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T152024Z-old-plan-iterative-isolated-plan/01-create-button-chain/steps/01-step-initial-markup-testing.md; review them for accuracy and completeness after updating this step.\\nUpdated paragraph\\nReminder: testing instructions already exist at .plans/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T152024Z-old-plan-iterative-isolated-plan/01-create-button-chain/steps/02-step-append-handler-testing.md; review them for accuracy and completeness after updating this step.\\nUpdated paragraph\\nReminder: testing instructions already exist at .plans/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T152024Z-old-plan-iterative-isolated