ask to review: durable planning-only proof for future creation of button-chain.html with one initial button; pressing the current last button appends exactly one button below it; pressing the fourth generated button clears the document; completion state prints exact lowercase text `finished` with a visible white border.\\n\\nPlan directory to review: /tmp/old-plan-iterative/current/workspace/.plans/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T152024Z-old-plan-iterative-isolated-plan\\n\\nRead the tagged planning/REVIEWER.md if present, otherwise planning/SKILL.md reviewer sections. Review the plan artifacts independently. If you approve, update adversarial-review.md so its verdict is approved and has no open findings, and write approval.json in the plan directory with reviewer_session_id, mode, approved_findings, rejected_findings, approved_at, and boolean overall_plan_approval. If you reject, write stable AR-NN findings with repository-relative path and precise location, observed contradiction or impact, evidence, and required correction, and set overall_plan_approval false. Final response should state whether you approved and list files changed.\",\"agents_states\":{},\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_63\",\"type\":\"collab_tool_call\",\"tool\":\"spawn_agent\",\"sender_thread_id\":\"019ff169-1ae4-75b1-a3ce-bfc833a8fd76\",\"receiver_thread_ids\":[\"019ff16e-539a-7892-b17f-83d1c0f25b87\"],\"prompt\":\"You are Reviewer B for a planning-skill benchmark, protocol 1.4.2. Work only inside /tmp/old-plan-iterative/current/workspace and the tagged capsule paths under /tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260811T152024Z-old-plan-iterative/current/worker/planning and /tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260811T152024Z-old-plan-iterative/current/worker/basic-test-proof-plan.md. Do not inspect parent dirs, git history, installed skills, HTML files, browsers, servers, or drivers. Do not create or test HTML.\\n\\nTask to review: durable planning-only proof for futu